     <p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-size:19px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;color:red">红色书评</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;color:red">一等奖</span></strong><span style="font-size: 16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;color:#0070C0">【计1学分（12学时）/份，高一计入“研究性学习”栏】</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">102</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">严实，张严涛</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">109</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">孔润冰，凌思瑜，沈佳颖</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">206</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">董欣雨</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">207</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">胡诗渝，董思佳</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">210</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;color:black">冯佳楠，戴昊，潘羽嫣</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">214</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">田野，吴仕栋</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">215</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">丁汉韬，宋彦博，倪佳琪，祁意城</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体"></span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;background:aqua;background:aqua">216</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;background:aqua;background:aqua">施晨阳</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体"> </span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;color:red">二等奖</span></strong><span style="font-size: 16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;color:#0070C0">【计0.5学分（6学时）/份，高一计入“研究性学习”栏】</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">101</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈冲，邓冯玮，洪歆玥，胡嘉，刘语桐，沈晔盈，沈子炫，宋雨欣，宋禹泽，唐睿，唐秀聚，唐与涵，汪于靖，尉涵杰 ，宣澍苗，杨震垠，俞可炀，张吴健</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">102</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">曾奕豪，陈飞帆，戴煦力，单静怡，傅嘉钰，金旅道，兰雨婷，卢平洋，邱子怡，沈俊磊，宋晨语，唐恺洛，唐琪佳，朱毅轩，周常乐，严思杰，俞涵康，王祎宁，喻晨宁</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">103</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈梓菲，单雨涵，范一之，冯逍播，黄毅成，钮天宸，蒲加培，阮铮，商煜航，宋加，唐仁本<span style="font-family: 宋体;">，陈梓菲，陈郦超，陈均浩，陈佳妮，陈锴</span></span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">105</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">朱李璐，朱怡然，陈致琬，褚诗怡，范思祺，冯家源，何勤瑶，蒋巍巍，金晨希，茹灵烨，王孙晨，王宇乐，王昱文，严佳艺，叶艺，俞灵楠，钟浩</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">106</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">高颖莹，卢雪凝，胡笑涵，刘烨，陆麦莎，骆宇炎，钱沁颐，沈康明，沈昕妤，施博文，吴成康，肖昳涵，谢逸群，徐煜峰，徐力飞，杨磊，杨诗瑜，于经纬，朱莹</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">109</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈文杰、陈文泽、孔润冰、孙朝阳、周晨涛、朱悦月</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">111</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">柴闻祺，戴天佑，王逸楠，徐依纬</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">112</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">冯宁馨，蒋怡宁，邓欣悦，陈雨扬，夏颖萱，徐颖，娄鸿哲，黄涛，裘驷浩，汤正清，张晨雨</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">113</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">叶恬奕，朱晟颉，朱金琦</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">114</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">何吾健，孟祖琰，季燃，沈沁蓝，祁意洋，郭佳杰，陈可昱</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">115</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">高格格，胡航奕，贾昀皓，蒋熠帆，揭李芳，金焰涛，郦涵宇，沈颖跃，史亦真，陶佳宇，尉启伦</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">116</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">沈铮，王诗雨，张涵，张颖，张雨涵，章涵信，朱宏泽</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">201</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈煜鑫，蒋奔月，金宏辉，毛天依，邵雨赞，严琪铭，杨凯程，叶诚豪，钟泓逸，朱泓瑶</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">202</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">鲁祚汀，金磊，金知愚1，金知愚2，金熠栋，葛笑非，樊辰昊，梁钰雯，孟午阳，孟逸浩，何子墨,童炯亮，王天烨，王一川，吴梦卿，吴越，徐鲲鹏2，严佳媛，杨陈韬，应君杭，于点1，于点2，张轶凡，章涛，赵天晨，郑柳锋1，郑柳锋2，钟佳怡，诸方奇</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">203</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈可思，陈乐扬，单晨濠，何钧燿，黄翊珊，寿琰炜，王瑜，叶恬甜</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">204</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈钶，李谞远，徐铭扬，余梓诚</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">205</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">裘舒雯</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">206</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">许冰卿</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">207</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">胡越涵，徐嘉若，王莎莎，沈颖颖，张祎楠，吴默，何佳楠，冯源，周嘉昀，冯烜，阮方舟，纽玥昕，余伊诺，单璟宜，包雨凡，茹晓玮，顾晓依，傅颖</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">208</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">顾李衡，金露云，潘宇青，钱诗雨，王淇，夏翊旻，杨雨虹，叶凯鸥，虞谢凯，朱贝睿</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">209</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">王易文，赵弃梦，何筱煜，方俞钰，龚思沁，韩浩，胡鍚琰，蒋静怡，唐诗，吴金月，徐逸辰，张彦彬</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">210</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">李淑恬，张伟婷，金函羽，张成康，王怡宁，姚越，宋裕峰，黄楠，冯歆普，费瑜，冯清怡</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">211</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈姝儿，何奕楠，常安，沈超，陈思榆，董雨诺，胡雨晨，金佳怡，任江华，史悠旸，孙艺萌，汤越玥，唐涵滢，王磊，王思淇，吴思楠，夏熠轩，俞姝婷，张雪婷，章润泽，周兴，诸欣瑜</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">212</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">徐越婷，佳烨，黎露，朱豪丰</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">214</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">马俊宇，潘禛玙，陶金晨，肖溶，张皓，叶佳和，张道毅，陈家俊，何天乐，解轩，凌斌炜，罗浩然，高锦程，陈佳颖，陈淡，钟延</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">215</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">王琦，王健，吴志浩，陈仰望</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体"></span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;background:aqua;background:aqua">216</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;background:aqua;background:aqua">包恩泽，樊文清，冯毅成，刘韵清，陶于嘉(1)，陶于嘉（2），王嘉航，王梦囡，俞晨露，张蕾，张思琪</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">
</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">注：不合格的书评未在此列。</span></span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-size:19px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;color:red">党员访谈</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;color:red">注：多人采访同一位对象的，若访谈报告相同，则学分平分，若访谈报告不同，则视为不同报告，单独计分。</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;color:red">一等奖</span></strong><span style="font-size: 16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;color:#0070C0">【计1学分（12学时）/份，高一计入“研究性学习”栏】</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">101</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">韩泽南，黄筱雅，马赫优，谭佳怡</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">102</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">戴唯，傅奕杰</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">103</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">张逸磊，赵正阳</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">104</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">袁宇轩</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">105</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">阮佳慧，朱庭慧，周嘉一，张景康</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">106</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">郑灵曜，朱颖</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">107</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">章潇丹</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">108</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">房可颜，屠坪儿，王雨霜，杨予希</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">109</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">丁逸萱，任逍遥，孙可闻，王子琪，徐蒋帅</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">110</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">高潘卓儿，陆陶然，余一鸣，赵立扬</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">111</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">余箐洋，朱嘉悦</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">114</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">冯佳楠，金雨欣，骆俊哲，徐婧怡，张扬</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">116</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">裘婕</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">201</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">骆家辉，钱淼祺，章宇昕</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">202</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">贺宸欣，</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">周琪涵，</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">宋浩喆，张思成，章简</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">203</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">王辰玥</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">204</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">金湛</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">205</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">傅可欣，李承颢，徐青珺</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">206</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">谢明涛，张聆琪，刘禺晗，吕月瑶，孙佳敏，冯思函</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">207</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">蔡欣怡，胡婧蕾，李佳怡，裴津漫，茹晓玮，沈楚楚，沈佳璇，屠佳琦，王玥儿，徐嘉若，许逸菲，赵芷萱</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">208</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">孙逸飞，朱贝睿资</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">209</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">李婧鸿</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">210</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陶洲宁</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">211</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">宋雨恬，戚仁杰</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">212</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">赵诗莹，郑宇英</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">213</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">张宇奇</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">214</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈宇实</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体"> </span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;color:red">二等奖</span></strong><span style="font-size: 16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;color:#0070C0">【计0.5学分（6学时）/份，高一计入“研究性学习”栏】</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">101</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">傅彬尔，马天泽，裘家瑞，万沅昕，汪泓烨</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">102</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">王煜，宋泽钧，宋佳怡，徐旸，叶乐天，朱弘阳</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">103</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">金烨乔，汪佳琦</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">104</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">莫皓翔</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">105</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">袁玮霞，王怡楠，沈家伟，陈佳颜，陈炜烨，高振轩，黄佳逸</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">106</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">车佳盈，李易柔，张瑜洁</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">108</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">包学彦，邵佳怡</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">109</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">胡欣怡，王佳怡，王奕彤，张奕琪</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">110</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈舒可，唐静妍，屠谢晨，赵思颖，郑荣发，周璐扬</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">111</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">赵泓媛</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">112</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">李圆圆，邢佳韵，张恺瑞</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">114</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">顾何佳</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">116</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈紫约，单晨怿，沈逸</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">201</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">冯欣凯，吕嘉欣，陶誉升，王洪铖，何时晴，马思远，毛天依，茹今，张熠彬</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">202</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">冯重雨，高嘉怡</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">203</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">包采奕，陈立言，李雨禾 203寿琰炜，龚典乐，黄翊珊，李灼垚，孟城科，孟哲，谢逸楠，徐嘉路</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">204</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">刘戴乐 204徐泽羽，李思涵</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">205</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">蒋拓航，秦小鑫，唐睿洋，王钰天</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">207</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">单宜越，叶炡楠</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">209</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈灏杨，李昊哲，沈娇，王奕然</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">211</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">包沂妤，范燕燕,金逸晗，钱明磊，孙乐陶，唐涵滢，王吉琦，袁艺凌，张锦芝，张雪婷，杨蕾箐</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">212</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">支怡溯</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">213</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">吕羿帆，潘杭超，沈耀，宋一笑，王佳辉，魏子淏，赵浩森，郑晓雯，周胜烨</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">214</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈浩文</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">215</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">胡铖阳，谢莹</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;background:aqua;background: aqua">216</span><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;background:aqua;background: aqua">曹智睿，陈遠洋，任逸文，沈震海，王嘉瑶，朱洪辉，朱紫滢</span></span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体"> </span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体;color:red">三等奖</span></strong><span style="font-size: 16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;color:#0070C0">【计0.5学分（6学时）/份，高一计入“研究性学习”栏】</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">102</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">诸乐轩，朱一鸣，周禛，夏江南，徐赫，王哲煜，俞景怡，陈添翼，陈乐言</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">108</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈烁，刁骏加，宋程毅</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">109</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈彦凝，樊祎闻，金孔语恬，凌思瑜</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">110</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">傅炯琰，顾则宇，李晨浩，徐一灵</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">111</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">金奕轲，李斯羽，王奕畅，张嘉宸</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">112</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">冯舒楠，徐文捷</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">114</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">胡一展，王子蘅</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">116</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">顾盼尔，沈熠宁，吴夏熠</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">201</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">单子颖</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">202</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">郑乐文</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">213</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">包展睿，戴佳豪，董鸿昊，鲁基垚，毛彦天，詹宇卿</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">214</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">陈伊，凌斌炜</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">215</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体">何伟恩贝，汪欣桐，吴志浩</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体"><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;background:aqua;background: aqua">216</span><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;background:aqua;background: aqua">封俊俊(1)，封俊俊(2) ，吕润圻(1)，吕润圻(2)，裘柯涵，史心瑜，周磊</span></span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;"> </span>
</p><p style="text-align:right;line-height:150%"><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-family: 宋体">校团委
2021年4月13日</span></p><p>
</p>
    
